Aim:
To develop a ComplainEase website for submitting and tracking complaints online.

Algorithm:

Create the webpage structure using HTML.
Apply CSS to design the website layout.
Use JavaScript to manage complaint details.
Provide a form to enter user and complaint details.
Allow users to select the complaint category.
Generate a complaint ID after submission.
Display the complaint status.
Allow users to search and track their complaints.

Result:
The ComplainEase website was developed successfully to submit and track complaints online.
